# xone-meeting-plugin

Greenfield standalone plugin. Build from `prd.md`, `tad.md`, `wbs_and_execution_plan.md`. Do not ALTER or copy Xone `governance_*`, `hr_employees`, or `project_tasks`. Ignore `TAD_Xone_2.md` and the Xone reuse map for implementation.

## Pillars

1. FullCalendar: Month, Week, Day, Resource Timeline; DnD; recurrence; conflict checks
2. Timeboxed agenda with presenters and pre-read attachments
3. TipTap + Yjs WebSockets; timers; flag Action / Decision
4. One-click convert via TaskPort; store `linked_task_id`
5. Local Ollama `qwen2.5:7b-instruct`; MoM sign-off; lock; PDF

## Stack

Next.js 14, FastAPI (Python 3.12), PostgreSQL, Redis, FullCalendar, TipTap, Yjs, local Ollama only.

## Layout

Root: `apps`, `core`, `workers`, `infrastructure`, `config`, `docs`, `tests`, `scripts`. Domain: `apps/meetings/{api,services,models,schemas,tests,prompts}`. UI: `apps/web`. Ports: `core/integrations`. Never `core/utils/`. No business logic in `api/`.

## Domain

Plugin-owned tables (`meetings`, `meeting_agenda_items`, `meeting_actions`, …). AI sets `is_candidate=true` only; workers never call TaskPort. `APPROVED` locks notes and agendas. Video is a join URL. Local commit first if Ollama or video is down.

## Out of scope

Native video engine, cloud LLMs, public calendar publish, meeting billing, auto-creating tasks from transcripts.
